# The observatory session account.
#
# Separate from `archie` on purpose: the native GPU client must not read the node's
# private key or open the control socket. It reaches Archie only through
# archie-displayd's bounded read-only loopback projection.
#
# Type Name           ID GECOS                        Home            Shell
u archie-display      -  "ArchieOS observatory"       /var/lib/archie-display /usr/bin/nologin
m archie-display video
m archie-display render
m archie-display input
